###

GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/interviews/1/
Authorization: Bearer <access-token>
###

POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/interviews/questions/2/answer/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <access-token>

{
    "answer_text": "A process is an independent program in execution, while a thread is a smaller unit of execution within a process."
}

###
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/interviews/questions/3/answer/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <access-token>

{
    "answer_text": "Authentication verifies who a user is, while authorization determines what that user is allowed to access."
}

